@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> Registration : [Citizen]
UserType --> Login : [Registered Citizen]

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details
Registration : if (details accepted) then Save User Information and go to Login else end process

state Login
Login : entry / Get username and password
Login : if (login successful) then go to Profile else provide multiple login attempts

state Profile
Profile : entry / Show profile details
Profile : [Citizen] can upload documents, view profile, apply for certificate, update profile, cancel certificate, or logout
Profile : [Registrar] can request certificates and logout

@enduml
